  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If a 3.0 avatar is made with a completely empty base layer (no nodes at all), it will cause the avatar preview in the avatar menu to break until the next reboot, making you unable to preview avatars before switching.\nThe avatar preview is instead shown in origo at world as in the screenshot.\nPutting in a single node sidesteps the problem.\nI've seen public avatars in the wild that exhibit this same issue. Which isn't that strange since a naive approach to making an avatar that has no walking/running motion will cause this to happen.",
